# MusicID needs NO build-time API keys.
#
# Anything prefixed with VITE_ is baked into the public JavaScript bundle and
# can be read by every visitor, so the AudD token and Musixmatch key are NOT
# configured here. Instead, each visitor enters them in the app's "Keys"
# panel; they are stored only in that browser's localStorage.
#
#   AudD API token      -> https://dashboard.audd.io/
#   Musixmatch API key  -> https://developer.musixmatch.com/
#
# Build-time settings used by .github/workflows/deploy.yml (not secrets):
# GITHUB_PAGES=true
# GITHUB_PAGES_REPO=musicid
